   176	> `c·deg chi_1 + (N-1)·deg chi_2 >= c + N - 1` (coordinates of an automorphism are
   177	> nonconstant). On the other hand `deg Jac G <= deg G_1 + deg G_2 - 2 <= 2 deg G - 2`.
