   298	### 3.3 Where the affine excess sits: `E-CHARGE` transported
   299	
   300	`E-CHARGE` (BE §3.2, BR CONFIRMED **with the contracted-model repair**, binding
   301	here: `Phi` is finite of degree `mu_t` at `t ∈ l'` only after contraction)
