   408	 is not fixed by the frozen replay, and the naive identification "B_l = the
   409	 L̃_∞-component that l meets" is NOT licensed: an explicit resolved model has l
   410	 meeting a contracted component at p̃.  ONLY Deg B_l = s_l mu_l is safely
   411	 consumable.  Any general-N successor that wants to invoke Corollary 4 ("no
   412	 degree-two fork") must settle the split first.
   413	 Consequence for this lane: NONE of BI-1..BI-6 uses the split; §4 flags the one
   414	 place (the Cor-4 step) where it would matter.
   415	```
