   171	Promoted `N=4` control: MI:N4-PIN gives `N=4`, `W=2`, `S=1`, generic cycle
   172	type `(2,1,1)`, cusp local type `(3,1)`, and double-point type `(2,2)` at
   173	MI:580-605. Thus MF-EXACT reads
   174	
   175	```text
   176	n = 2 + 2g_L + theta_inf.
   177	```
