   180	The LOC-MULT/Bezout computation below gives `n>=4` in the B3 profile, so the
   181	equality case is excluded there. If the minimal `n=4` is attained, then
   182	`2g_L+theta_inf=2`, hence necessarily `(g_L,theta_inf)=(0,2)`.
