   232	The local complement of a plane curve germ of multiplicity `m=mult_P(A_F)` is
   233	generated by `m` strand meridians after a generic projection. Under H2 these
   234	are conjugate in the global complement to the generic meridian, whose
   235	reflection length is `W-S`. Thus local block merge gives
   236	
   237	```text
   238	N - T_P <= mult_P(A_F) * (W-S).                         (1)
   239	```
